            <cmd>Open the query that is retrieving the data.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Add a filter as follows - this example uses Account/Opportunity but you should select the parent id field in the object that looks up to the parent.
               </cmd>
            <info>
               <p>
                  <fig>
                     <image height="71"
                            placement="break"
